:math:`A \in \mathbb{K}^{n \times n}` is defined as

.. math::

    A = Q \operatorname{diag}(\Lambda) Q^{\text{H}}\mathrlap{\qquad Q \in \mathbb{K}^{n \times n}, \Lambda \in \mathbb{R}^n}

